WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,590
Why do you need to ask the copy BOSS about this?

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:03,590
BOSS

3
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:05,780
About benefits

4
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,780
Can I discuss this with other staff?

5
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:09,780
You need to discuss it with him

6
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:10,780
Won't you have dinner with me?

7
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,780
Just a few words that don’t take up time

8
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,780
If BOSS you are hungry, you can eat first

9
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:15,780
I'll have a few words with him and it'll be over

10
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,940
you can discuss whatever you want

11
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,940
But in terms of benefits

12
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,940
only you are special

13
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,940
This group of interns

14
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,940
Am I the only one with the highest benefits?

15
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,940
The HR Committee will distribute welfare benefits based on ability

16
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:27,940
you deserve it

17
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,940
I just graduated and found a job.

18
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,940
I'm really being tossed around by all kinds of personnel.

19
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:36,940
As a result, this company actually recognized me so much. Come on, hurry up.

20
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:41,020
Otherwise I'd be really hungry

21
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:43,020
You and BOSS seem to have a good chat.

22
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:45,280
It’s BOSS who is easy to meet.

23
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,440
The benefits package was told to me by HR.

24
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:49,440
He may have forgotten to tell you

25
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,440
You can find out if you ask the personnel

26
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,440
The boss just said you are special

27
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,440
What are your benefits like?

28
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:54,440
Can I disclose it?

29
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,440
I told you not to talk about it everywhere

30
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:59,570
I'm worried that some people won't like me.

31
00:00:59,570 --> 00:01:02,050
I have the highest benefits

32
00:01:02,050 --> 00:01:05,050
For example, I can eat for free at these cafeteria windows.

33
00:01:05,050 --> 00:01:07,980
Thank you for your message. It's okay.

34
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:11,680
You said you would send me the company rules this afternoon

35
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,680
where did you get it

36
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,900
Ask the department leader for it

37
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,120
What's wrong with you

38
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,120
Are you okay?

39
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,120
Thank you for your concern

40
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,890
I'm fine

41
00:01:20,890 --> 00:01:22,980
I was sure it was him who suddenly attacked me

42
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:23,980
You go to eat

43
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:24,980
Be careful yourself
